        70.86609649658203,
        624.8363647460938,
        527.4354858398438,
        642.0733642578125
      ],
      "text": "Module 3: diagnosis – rapid diagnostics for tuberculosis detection, 2021 update (16)  Commercial  and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.964994430541992,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
