        70.86609649658203,
        667.2304077148438,
        406.14288330078125,
        681.6734008789062
      ],
      "text": "and monitoring and evaluation considerations, the source guidelines or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
