        406.8869934082031,
        667.2304077148438,
        474.5700378417969,
        681.6734008789062
      ],
      "text": "WHO’s TB KSP",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        474.56689453125,
        667.2304077148438,
        527.421875,
        681.6734008789062
      ],
      "text": "should be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        680.430419921875,
        117.63809204101562,
        694.8734130859375
      ],
      "text": "consulted.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        702.13427734375,
        527.42236328125,
        716.5772705078125
      ],
      "text": "The WHO convened an expert consultation on the classification of intrathoracic TB disease among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        715.3342895507812,
        527.5546264648438,
        729.7772827148438
      ],
      "text": "children in September 2021. The experts reviewed evidence from the point of view of pathophysiology,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.957266807556152,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        749.8717041015625,
        526.53759765625,
        763.57568359375
      ],
      "text": "Treatment decision algorithms are defined as: A flow chart allocating evidence-based scores to microbiological, clinical and radiological  23",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 7.995448589324951,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        81.86609649658203,
        762.6716918945312,
        384.94677734375,
        773.1756591796875
      ],
      "text": "features that allow clinicians to make a decision regarding starting TB treatment in children.",
